      en: ["The fort was completed in 1937 as part of the PFL defensive line", "It surrendered on May 29, 1940, following intense resistance", "The underground tunnel network exceeds 2 kilometers in length", "The main armament included 75mm and 120mm artillery pieces", "The fort is located at an altitude of 335 meters above sea level", "It is currently open to the public as a military history museum"],
