      en: ["The core of the current castle was built in the 15th century (c. 1410)", "The Beaufort family has owned the estate since the 12th century", "The castle features six iconic circular towers", "The inner courtyard contains timber galleries from the Renaissance", "The structure was partially damaged by fire in 1793", "The interior furnishings date mostly from the 18th century"],
      es: ["Construcción del castillo central actual en el siglo XV (hacia 1410).", "La familia Beaufort posee el castillo desde el siglo XII.", "El castillo cuenta con seis prominentes torres circulares.", "Patio interior con galerías de madera de la época renacentista.", "Destrucción parcial por un incendio en el año 1793.", "El mobiliario interior data principalmente del siglo XVIII."],
      pt: ["Construção do atual castelo central no século XV (por volta de 1410).", "A família Beaufort possui o castelo desde o século XII.", "O castelo possui seis torres redondas proeminentes.", "Pátio interior com galerias de madeira do Renascimento.", "Destruição parcial por um incêndio no ano de 1793.", "A decoração interior data principalmente do século XVIII."],
      fr: ["Construction du château central actuel au XVe siècle (vers 1410).", "La famille de Beaufort possède le château depuis le XIIe siècle.", "Le château dispose de six tours rondes remarquables.", "Cour intérieure avec des galeries en bois de la Renaissance.", "Destruction partielle par un incendie en 1793.", "L'aménagement intérieur date principalement du XVIIIe siècle."],
